-- words --
When hyp add goal cannot write the Goal's folder, it records no Goal: goals/ is read-only when the owner adds a Goal with the draft x, and hyp status then shows no Goal in work.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=owner HYP_ROLE=owner hyp add goal --base HEAD --words 'Count.' --line 'gap:the counter says ok.' --draft x >/dev/null 2>&1; HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status
-- floor: contains --
no Goal is in work
-- ceiling --
  open  runs:
-- findings --
F-FHBFK9
